{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/deploy/pulls/4","id":5104224142,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVelF_88AAAABMDxHjg","html_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent/deploy/pull/4","diff_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent/deploy/pull/4.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent/deploy/pull/4.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/deploy/issues/4","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/deploy/pulls/4/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/deploy/pulls/4/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/deploy/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/deploy/issues/4/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/deploy/statuses/1db43d3b1e1b1488f51aecf99db4c1b5fcf2bcd7","number":4,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"部署隔离中心 Stack 并验证持久卷与 Slurm 共享","user":{"login":"RiriAgent","id":39219425,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MjE5NDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39219425?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent","html_url":"https://github.com/RiriAgent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #2\n\n## 摘要\n\n本 PR 在既有隔离 Komodo 中交付 `pepgent-central`：lab-web、store、Mux、九个独立持久卷，以及 lab-web 对真实 Slurm 共享目录的只读挂载。声明与启动脚本来自 Git，凭据从已有私有 owner 文件写入 Komodo Variables；本 PR 不接管现有 S1。\n\n## 实现说明\n\n- `komodo/syncs/central.toml` 声明单一 Stack，`deploy=false`；`scripts/central.py` 负责来源刷新、受限预览、RunSync、落地读回和一次明确的 DeployStack，并等待 Core 持久 Update 的 Complete/success。实际 `DeployStackIfChanged` 返回过无持久 id 的进行中响应，因此本入口不使用条件部署推断终态。\n- 按 [issue 中已批准的测试环境裁决](https://github.com/Pepgent/deploy/issues/2#issuecomment-6553034458)，专用 `pepgent-deploy-sync` clone 仅派生自 push 后的 Git 内容。Core 从 `/syncs/pepgent-central` 只读读取 ResourceSync；Periphery 从相同宿主绝对路径只读读取 Compose。生成的私密 env 位于 Periphery 工作目录，不进入 clone。生产 GitProvider token 接入仍是 D9 差距。\n- `state-init` 只初始化本 Stack 的卷根及 HOME 内嵌套目录，不挂载 Slurm、S1 或 gateway owner 目录。`lab-entrypoint.sh` 从只读 consumer 输入刷新配置、运行真实发行 installer，然后 exec Node；不增加 installed marker 或伪 boot。\n- Mux 使用新 Stack 独立 bearer，gateway 使用 lab-web consumer token。当前已验证的 Mux serve/dial 配对保持不变，未消费上游尚未配对发布的新协议。Slurm 共享目录明确为 `/srv/pepgent-slurm-runs`，不在部署层实现 remote copy-in/out。\n- 阅读顺序为 `scripts/central.py` → `central.toml` → Compose/entrypoint。README 说明来源副本的刷新、失效、main 切换及卷生命周期。\n\n## 变更预演（Layer 1）\n\n环境：Mac OrbStack arm64，既有 Komodo Core/Periphery 2.3.4，Server `pepgent-test`。在容器保卷销毁之后、重新部署之前执行：\n\n```sh\npython3 scripts/central.py preview --branch issue-2-central-stack\npython3 scripts/central.py apply --branch issue-2-central-stack\n```\n\n实际输出（exit 0）：\n\n```json\n{\"source\":\"Pepgent/deploy\",\"branch\":\"issue-2-central-stack\",\"commit\":\"f744610d5fb80a43699ed800e1d7485a0eb08c03\"}\n{\"sync\":\"pepgent-central\",\"repo\":\"Pepgent/deploy\",\"branch\":\"issue-2-central-stack\",\"resource_updates\":[],\"variable_update_count\":0}\n{\"operation\":\"RunSync\",\"update\":\"6ae6b927608b239bc3f09d16\",\"status\":\"Complete\",\"success\":true}\n{\"operation\":\"DeployStack\",\"update\":\"6ae6b928608b239bc3f09d18\",\"status\":\"Complete\",\"success\":true}\n```\n\n无声明差异不等于有容器；此处仍明确请求 DeployStack，从已存在的声明重建实际容器。Sync 自身不重复发起部署。当前新增的截图 commit 不改变运行配置。\n\n## 落地核对（Layer 2）\n\n真实 Core 读回 Stack 使用 `files_on_host=true`，run_directory 为 `/Users/mouriya/Ext/work/orbstack/pepgent-deploy-sync/stacks/pepgent-central`，file_paths 为 `[\"compose.yaml\"]`。三项 Variable 注入后，私下读取与各自 owner 输入匹配，输出仅含名称、secret 属性和 `readback: matched`，未输出值。\n\n通过 `docker inspect pepgent-central-lab-web pepgent-central-store pepgent-central-mux` 对照重建前后实际对象：\n\n| 服务 | 重建前容器 ID 前缀 | 重建后容器 ID 前缀 | 保留的同名卷 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| lab-web | `95f0e2c2b0ad` | `d513d790cff0` | 8 个，挂载点完全一致 |\n| store | `7bc99a2e072a` | `efbf02a861c9` | 1 个 store-data |\n| mux | `d7213d5bfde3` | `955f3663fb47` | 0 个，无状态 |\n\nlab-web 的 Slurm bind 实际源为 `/Users/mouriya/Ext/work/orbstack/pepgent-slurm/runs`、目标 `/srv/pepgent-slurm-runs`、`RW=false`。release、gateway 配置和 tracked entrypoint 也只读。卷名均以 `pepgent-central-` 开头，没有复用 S1 卷。\n\n## 启动 / 运行时顺序（Layer 3）\n\n`docker logs pepgent-central-lab-web` 在最终重建后观察到 installer 输出先于 Node listener：\n\n```text\n{\"version\":\"1d083de6835740e32885a642d518668c655eb5ba\",\"packageRoot\":\"/home/agent/.omp/soroi/e69b2fbaedbf2e73570c8a246954ed43eb29f9df4fda33017526033bc09dca39/packages/omp-soroi\",\"settings\":[],\"command\":\"/home/agent/.local/bin/soroi\"}\n[pepgent-web] listening at http://0.0.0.0:3000\n```\n\n初次启动确实暴露嵌套 sessions mount 导致的 HOME 子目录 root ownership，已通过仅初始化自有 `.omp/agent` 目录修复；最终重建完整重走 installer→Node，而非只验证最后一条命令。\n\n## 端到端业务行为（Layer 4）\n\n### 容器重建后业务数据仍可读取\n\n通过 store 正式 HTTP API 创建真实 EvalTransfer，再 `POST /runs/steps` 建立含数值根 `deployment_probe=41753` 的 run，最后 `POST /runs/{run}/end`。真实 run 为 `01M6AM0BFQHAY5M8K8T3ADSQVB`，重建前为 Ended/at4。\n\n随后通过 Core 执行仅此 Stack 的 DestroyStack（Update `6ae6b914608b239bc3f09d11`，Complete/success=true；不删卷），再执行上面的 preview/apply。最终 `GET http://pepgent-central-store.orb.local:3001/runs/01M6AM0BFQHAY5M8K8T3ADSQVB/graph` 返回：\n\n```json\n{\"run\":\"01M6AM0BFQHAY5M8K8T3ADSQVB\",\"state\":\"Ended\",\"at\":4,\"nodes\":[{\"kind\":\"Root\",\"name\":\"deployment_probe\",\"value\":{\"kind\":\"scalar\",\"scalar\":{\"kind\":\"number\",\"v\":41753}}}],\"edges\":[],\"unconsumed\":[]}\n```\n\n这是由 store 自己写入并在新容器中读回的业务状态，不是 host touch、摘要比对或只看卷存在。\n\n### Slurm 作业产物可从 lab-web 读取\n\n执行既有权威入口（exit 0）：\n\n```sh\npython3 /Users/mouriya/Ext/work/orbstack/pepgent-slurm/smoke.py\n```\n\n原始完成回读：\n\n```json\n{\"job_id\":76,\"job_state\":[\"COMPLETED\"],\"exit_code\":{\"status\":[\"SUCCESS\"],\"return_code\":{\"set\":true,\"infinite\":false,\"number\":0}},\"result\":{\"nonce\":\"86200c36d94f49b88989b2aa65f4b2c9\",\"job_id\":\"76\",\"arch\":\"aarch64\",\"container_os\":\"alpine-3.24.3\"},\"mac_directory\":\"/Users/mouriya/Ext/work/orbstack/pepgent-slurm/runs/smoke-86200c36d94f49b88989b2aa65f4b2c9\",\"guest_directory\":\"/srv/pepgent-runs/smoke-86200c36d94f49b88989b2aa65f4b2c9\"}\n```\n\n随后执行（exit 0）：\n\n```sh\ndocker exec pepgent-central-lab-web cat /srv/pepgent-slurm-runs/smoke-86200c36d94f49b88989b2aa65f4b2c9/result.txt\n```\n\n读取到相同 nonce、job_id=76、arch=aarch64、container_os=alpine-3.24.3。作业写入、共享卷和 Lab 读取贯通；controller 的短期 job retention 不改变已经采集的完成回读。\n\n### 真实 Mux→dial→omp RPC 与浏览器\n\n在最终 lab-web 容器内用一次性 Bun driver，通过部署的 `SOROI_MUX_URL` 和注入 bearer 打开 writer，取得真实 generation/token，启动镜像内 `omp-rpc-mux dial -- omp --mode rpc --no-session --no-title --no-context-files --no-lsp`，等待 ready，发送 `get_state`，最后携带 generation 发送 `mux_close_stdin`。实际输出：\n\n```text\nwriter opened\n{\"received\":\"mux_generation\"}\n{\"received\":\"mux_attached\"}\n{\"received\":\"ready\"}\n{\"received\":\"response\",\"success\":true}\n{\"dialExit\":0,\"stderr\":\"\"}\n{\"received\":\"mux_exited\",\"code\":0}\n{\"writer\":true,\"generation\":true,\"attached\":true,\"ompReady\":true,\"getState\":true,\"muxExited\":0,\"dialExit\":0}\n```\n\n第一次 driver 漏发 close_stdin 的 generation 导致超时，修正 driver 后完整重跑通过；没有修改或掩盖服务错误。正确 WebSocket upgrade、无 bearer 的独立请求被真实服务拒绝为 HTTP401；普通 HTTP GET 的400不是认证证据。\n\nYab 实际打开 `http://127.0.0.1:59410`，Home→Compute→Sandbox Clusters，再刷新 `/compute/clusters`，页面保持正常渲染。截图中的业务展示来自现有 Web source，不据此宣称真实 cluster catalog、登录或完整 Lab 操作已经实现。\n\n![实际部署的 Compute 页面](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Pepgent/deploy/1db43d3/evidence/central-compute.jpg)\n\n## 未验证与边界\n\n完整 Lab 认证/安装后工具清单仍由 [images live child](https://github.com/Pepgent/images/issues/6) 验收；当前只对 loopback 暴露。DEP-02 的 catalog 和 ENV-04 JWT 尚在独立切片内。当前真实安装基线不含 boot，[DEP-03](https://github.com/Pepgent/deploy/issues/1) 等待 store release API 和真实发行物，不构造假 ReleaseRecord、不直接写 store objects。\n\n独立 source review 已逐行检查五个实现文件与完整 README，未发现确认的 in-scope 缺陷；review 不冒充 runtime。合并后将用同一入口在 main 重新 preview/apply，并在本 PR thread 发布 main 来源与实际终态，之后移除临时 issue worktree。\n\n## 分析\n\nCore 成功终态、独立卷和实际容器替换共同证明声明能从既有隔离控制面部署并重建。真实 store run 的 Ended/at4/41753 读回与真实 Slurm job76 产物读取分别覆盖持久化和跨运行环境共享，不以 Running 或首页 HTTP200代替验收。Mux 的完整 RPC 生命周期和浏览器路由验证覆盖新中心的实际入口，但不扩大到尚未交付的上游认证、remote catalog 或 release API。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-01T04:06:54Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T04:08:03Z","closed_at":"2026-11-01T04:07:43Z","merged_at":"2026-11-01T04:07:43Z","merge_commit_sha":"68b918c9ade2cba7e55e19650a49161b03459c0b","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Pepgent:issue-2-central-stack","ref":"issue-2-central-stack","repo":{"id":1441351167,"node_id":"R_kgDOVelF_w","name":"deploy","full_name":"Pepgent/deploy","owner":{"login":"Pepgent","id":327843718,"node_id":"O_kgDOE4p_hg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/327843718?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent","html_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/events{/privacy}","rec